OL,3,GNEWSASamaritans urged to reconsider
OL,4,Abranch closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of North Lincolnshire
OL,7,FCouncil has urged the Samaritans to
OL,8,Freconsider plans to close its
OL,9,FScunthorpe branch and charity shop.
OL,11,FCouncil leader Rob Waltham has written
OL,12,Fto the charity's chief executive, Julie
OL,13,FBentley, calling for the proposals to
OL,14,Fbe put on hold until at least the end
OL,15,Fof January 2027.
OL,17,FHe said the delay would give volunteers
OL,18,Fand local partners time to develop an
OL,19,Falternative plan to keep the service
OL,20,Foperating.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
