OL,3,GNEWSASamaritans urged to reconsider
OL,4,Abranch closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said the plans were part of
OL,7,Fa programme to strengthen and modernise
OL,8,Fthe service, with a network of fewer
OL,9,Flarger branches across the UK.
